- ✓ Executive_Summary is not empty
- ✓ At least one item in Detailed_Findings (unless no-findings rule applies)
- ✓ pages_analyzed lists all evaluated UI components
- ✓ false_positives_excluded documents PI found but not flagged
- ✓ compliance_status reflects actual policy compliance
- ✓ All findings explicitly reference IPD-820 or IPD-821
- ✓ No findings for search input fields
- ✓ All account+PI pairs validated for well-formedness

